    "title": "PennWest University names James Fisher as interim president - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kellen Stepler ,\n17 hours ago Former Pennsylvania Western University administrator James “JD” Fisher will return to the school as interim president. The State System of Higher Education’s Board of Governors on Wednesday named Fisher to the position. His appointment comes less than a month after he left PennWest to become interim vice chancellor and chief academic officer of the state system. Read full article\n1",
